{"openapi":"3.2.0","info":{"title":"Saldor API","version":"0.1.0","description":"The Saldor API powers Saldor's procure-to-pay platform — purchase orders, item receipts, invoices, vendor management, and three-way matching. Every response is enveloped as `{ data, meta? }`; errors as `{ error: { code, message } }`. \n\n## Authentication\n\nAll endpoints require a bearer token. Create an API key in **Settings** at [console.saldor.com](https://console.saldor.com) and pass it as `Authorization: Bearer <key>`."},"servers":[{"url":"https://console.saldor.com"}],"security":[{"BearerAuth":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"Vendors"},{"name":"Vendor Onboarding"},{"name":"Budgeting"},{"name":"Integrations"},{"name":"Sourcing"},{"name":"BOMs","x-displayName":"BOMs"},{"name":"Inventory"},{"name":"Purchases"},{"name":"Quotes"},{"name":"Contracts"},{"name":"Workflows","description":"Approval workflows, in three layers. A **template** is the org's reusable approval graph — exactly one per type (procurement_request, vendor_approval, vendor_edit, bom_revision). When a document needs approval the template is snapshotted into an **instance** frozen onto that subject; editing a template never touches in-flight instances. People then act on an instance's **nodes** (approve/reject/send-back, or claim/unclaim a team-queue step)."},{"name":"Tasks"},{"name":"Calendar"},{"name":"Teams"},{"name":"Addresses"},{"name":"Item Receipts"},{"name":"Bills"},{"name":"Spend","description":"Where the money went, and the limits drawn on it. One report groups spend by supplier or team for a period, and carries each group's budget inline — a budget is a limit annotated on a row of that report, not an object with a page of its own, so the only writes are setting and clearing the number."},{"name":"Three-Way Match","x-displayName":"Three-Way Match"},{"name":"Exceptions"},{"name":"Settings","description":"Org-level configuration for how the engine behaves: the three-way matching policy, the fallback owner for unassignable exceptions, and the ordered exception-routing rules. Each is an org-singleton document with its own GET/PUT. Most are admin-only."},{"name":"Comments","description":"Conversation logs across procurement. Every commentable object — procurement requests, purchase orders, item receipts, invoices, sourcing events — shares one flat resource: address a thread by `subject_type` + `subject_id` rather than a per-object URL. System notes the engine records (rejection reasons, send-backs) appear here too, alongside human comments."},{"name":"Events","description":"The org's append-only activity log. One immutable event is emitted for every meaningful change across procurement — POs, invoices, receipts, teams, workflows — so the feed doubles as an audit trail. Events are written internally as a side effect of mutations (there is no create endpoint); this tag is the read side. Filter by `type`, or by `subject_type` + `subject_id` to pull a single object's full history oldest-first. The one verb here is undo: reversing a line-item edit is addressed by the event that recorded it."},{"name":"Users","description":"The org's people. Members with an account sign in through an invitation; placeholder members (`is_placeholder`) have none — an admin added them so work could be routed to, or tried against, someone who has no seat yet. Both are assignable everywhere. A placeholder is never emailed, cannot sign in, and is adopted (keeping its history) if it is later invited for real."},{"name":"Organization"},{"name":"Search"}],"paths":{"/api/vendors":{"post":{"summary":"Create a vendor","tags":["Vendors"],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorCreate"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Create a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Vendor"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"get":{"summary":"List vendors","tags":["Vendors"],"parameters":[{"in":"query","name":"limit","schema":{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":1000}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"List vendors","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Vendor"}},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}":{"get":{"summary":"Get a vendor","tags":["Vendors"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Get a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Vendor"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"patch":{"summary":"Update a vendor","description":"Admin-only. Edits a vendor's fields. When the vendor is approved, a real change is HELD behind a vendor_edit workflow (returned as `pending_edit`) instead of applied — 409 if one is already in flight. A pending vendor or a no-op change applies immediately.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorPatch"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Update a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorPatched"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"delete":{"summary":"Delete a vendor","description":"Admin-only hard delete. Removes the vendor and cascades/nulls related records (historical purchase orders, requests, contracts, receipts and sourcing awards are detached, not deleted). 404 if the vendor doesn't exist.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Delete a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["deleted"],"additionalProperties":false},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/onboarding":{"post":{"summary":"Start vendor onboarding","description":"**Admin only.** Kicks off the onboarding/approval workflow for a pending vendor so an admin can review and approve it. When the workflow template includes a portal-invite step, the vendor is emailed a portal invite (if it has a contact email) to submit its profile; otherwise it's a direct admin review. A procurement request that names this vendor stays blocked at its final approval until the vendor is approved. No-op if the vendor already has an onboarding workflow running.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Start vendor onboarding","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Vendor"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/approve":{"post":{"summary":"Approve a vendor","description":"Approves a pending vendor by acting on its vendor_approval workflow's current step as that step's assignee — only the person whose turn it is may act (others, org admins included, get 403 not_assignee), exactly like a procurement request. Completing the flow promotes any submitted onboarding profile and unblocks every procurement request waiting on this vendor. 409 if the vendor has no active approval flow (restart it first).","tags":["Vendors"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApproveVendorBody"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Approve a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Vendor"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/restart-approval":{"post":{"summary":"Restart a vendor's approval","description":"**Admin only.** Re-opens a FRESH vendor_approval workflow for a pending vendor whose approval was rejected (or that has no active flow) — the vendor analogue of resubmitting a rejected procurement request. The prior rejected instance is kept for audit. 422 if the vendor is already approved or already has an active approval.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Restart a vendor's approval","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Vendor"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/pending-edit":{"get":{"summary":"Get a vendor's held change","description":"Returns the approved vendor's currently-held change awaiting vendor_edit approval — the proposed field changes (each field's new value), which are applied on approval and discarded on rejection. null when nothing is pending.","tags":["Vendors"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Get a vendor's held change","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorPendingEdit"},{"type":"null"}]},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/catalog":{"get":{"summary":"List a vendor's catalog items","tags":["Vendors"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"List a vendor's catalog items","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CatalogItem"}},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/emails":{"get":{"summary":"List a vendor's email addresses","tags":["Vendors"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"List a vendor's email addresses","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorEmail"}},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"post":{"summary":"Add an email address to a vendor","description":"**Admin only.** Adds an address we'll trust inbound mail (lead times, invoices) from for this vendor. The vendor's primary `email` is always trusted; this adds extras (e.g. ap@, billing@). An address already owned by a vendor is rejected.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorEmailCreate"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Add an email address to a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorEmail"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/emails/{emailId}":{"patch":{"summary":"Update a vendor's email address","description":"**Admin only.** Edits an additional address in place. The primary (the vendor's `email`) is changed by editing the vendor. An address already owned by a vendor is rejected.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true},{"in":"path","name":"emailId","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorEmailUpdate"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Update a vendor's email address","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorEmail"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"delete":{"summary":"Remove an email address from a vendor","description":"**Admin only.** Removes an additional address. The primary (the vendor's `email`) is cleared by editing the vendor.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true},{"in":"path","name":"emailId","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Remove an email address from a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"removed":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["removed"],"additionalProperties":false},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/domains":{"get":{"summary":"List a vendor's allow-listed domains","tags":["Vendors"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"List a vendor's allow-listed domains","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorDomain"}},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"post":{"summary":"Allow-list a domain for a vendor","description":"**Admin only.** Trusts inbound mail (lead times, invoices) from ANY address on this domain — and its subdomains — for this vendor, without listing each address. A specific address always takes precedence over a domain. A domain already owned by a vendor is rejected; consumer mailbox domains are refused.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorDomainCreate"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Allow-list a domain for a vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VendorDomain"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/vendors/{id}/domains/{domainId}":{"delete":{"summary":"Remove an allow-listed domain from a vendor","description":"**Admin only.** Stops trusting mail from this domain. Addresses listed individually are unaffected.","tags":["Vendors"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","f