ent":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/InventoryMovement"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases":{"post":{"summary":"Create a purchase","description":"Creates an empty purchase (an umbrella you can attach documents to). Usually a purchase is minted automatically when its first document is created.","tags":["Purchases"],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseCreate"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Create a purchase","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Purchase"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"get":{"summary":"List purchases","description":"Every purchase in the org, newest activity first, each with its derived milestones, amount and timeline. Archived purchases are hidden unless `include_archived`. `expand=lines` inlines each purchase's own line items (a line with `po_id` set is on its order).","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"query","name":"vendor_id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"}},{"in":"query","name":"include_archived","schema":{"description":"Include archived purchases (hidden by default).","type":"string"},"description":"Include archived purchases (hidden by default)."},{"in":"query","name":"include_drafts","schema":{"description":"Include draft purchases — requests not yet published for approval (hidden by default).","type":"string"},"description":"Include draft purchases — requests not yet published for approval (hidden by default)."},{"in":"query","name":"limit","schema":{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":1000}},{"in":"query","name":"expand","schema":{"description":"Comma list of relations to inline. `lines` adds each purchase's own line items.","type":"string"},"description":"Comma list of relations to inline. `lines` adds each purchase's own line items."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"List purchases","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Purchase"}},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases/{id}":{"get":{"summary":"Get a purchase","description":"One purchase with its milestones (each with evidence documents), its own line items, and its full document timeline, derived on read.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Get a purchase","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Purchase"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"patch":{"summary":"Update a purchase","description":"Edits the purchase's title, vendor, assignee, or estimated delivery date. Title/vendor/estimated delivery date are human-asserted facts that outrank values derived from documents or quote lead times; reassigning the assignee re-routes the purchase's open default-owned tasks to the new owner.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchasePatch"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Update a purchase","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Purchase"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"delete":{"summary":"Delete a purchase","description":"Admin-only hard delete of a buy that should never have existed (an order raised for the wrong amount, a duplicate, test data). Removes the purchase AND everything filed under it — its purchase order, bills, item receipts, quotes and the request that raised it — along with their lines, three-way-match state and stored documents. The purchase order's number is released back to the PO counter when it was the newest one issued, so the sequence keeps no hole. The sourcing event it came out of survives, and vendor email threads are unlinked rather than deleted. 404 if the purchase doesn't exist.","tags":["Purchases"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Delete a purchase","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["deleted"],"additionalProperties":false},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases/{id}/lines/{lineKey}":{"patch":{"summary":"Update a purchase line","description":"Edits one reconciled line of the purchase (keyed by the line's `key`). Dates: passing null clears the override, so the line falls back to the purchase's document-wide expected delivery date (or the order header's need-by). Figures: changing `quantity` or `unit_price` is a change order — the line keeps its id, so every item receipt and bill already matched to it stays matched and the three-way match re-derives against the new figures. Returns the updated purchase.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true},{"in":"path","name":"lineKey","schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseLinePatch"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Update a purchase line","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Purchase"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases/{id}/state":{"get":{"summary":"Derived purchase state","description":"Allocation tallies, derived states, settlement per line; closing + classification.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Derived purchase state","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PoState"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases/{id}/order":{"get":{"summary":"Get a purchase's order","description":"The purchase's one purchase order — its header plus its full three-way match — and the line-level matching that goes with it: the derived per-line states (exceptions, acceptances, waits), the match edges backing each linked receipt/bill, who owns each exception, and the documents the engine suggests belong to a line. `order` is null until an order exists; `send` then says whether one can still be sent to the vendor and what it's waiting on. A purchase carries at most one order. Read-only — acting on a match goes through /api/matches/{accept,reject} and the exception endpoints; editing the order goes through PATCH /api/purchases/{id}/order.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Get a purchase's order","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseOrderPayload"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"patch":{"summary":"Update the order's contract metadata and document fields","description":"Updates the governing contract link only. PO lifecycle status and lines are not patchable.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseOrderPatch"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Update the order's contract metadata and document fields","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseOrder"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}},"delete":{"summary":"Delete the purchase's order","description":"Admin-only hard delete. Removes the PO along with its lines, derived three-way-match state, and email threads (all cascade via FKs). Matched invoices and item receipts are unaffected — they link through matching, not a PO foreign key, so they simply re-derive with no PO. 404 if the PO doesn't exist.","tags":["Purchases"],"x-admin":true,"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Delete the purchase's order","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["deleted"],"additionalProperties":false},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases/{id}/order/send":{"post":{"summary":"Send the purchase's order to the vendor","description":"Creates the purchase order for the approved request behind this purchase and emails it to the vendor. A purchase is minted when its request is approved; this is the explicit step that turns it into an order the vendor has. 422 no_request unless an approved, non-blanket request is waiting; 422 unless it's ready (an approved vendor, line items, a vendor email, a shipping address); 409 if the order was already sent; 403 unless you raised the request, coordinate it, or are an admin. Returns the purchase's order payload.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Send the purchase's order to the vendor","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseOrderPayload"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases/{id}/order/contract-suggestions":{"get":{"summary":"Suggest contracts to attach to this order","description":"The mirror of /api/contracts/{id}/po-suggestions, ranked for one unlinked order. Read-only.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Suggest contracts to attach to this order","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ContractSuggestion"}},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/purchases/{id}/order/contract":{"post":{"summary":"Attach a contract to the order","description":"Links a contract to an unlinked order (provenance `suggested`). 422 if it already has one.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AttachContractBody"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Attach a contract to the order","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseOrderWithMatch"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Inva