rn of the purchase agent with the buyer's message and the live purchase context. The agent answers from context or uses its tools — any email it drafts, or fact/date it proposes, is queued for the buyer to confirm (nothing is sent or changed on its own). Returns the buyer message and the agent's reply; the reply's run_id keys the queued items rendered inline in the thread.","tags":["Purchases"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SendAgentMessage"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Send a message to a purchase's agent","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AgentThreadView"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/quotes/{id}":{"get":{"summary":"Get a quote","description":"One quote — the vendor's negotiation chain, its versions (each with line items) in order, and its state.","tags":["Quotes"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Get a quote","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Quote"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/quotes/{id}/accept":{"post":{"summary":"Accept a quote","description":"Accepts the vendor's quote, soft-declines the offers it beat (reversibly), and carries the winning offer into a draft purchase — published straight away, so it runs the org's approval workflow. 422 quote_not_priced if the quote has no line items, or any line is missing a quantity or a price: the purchase it raises couldn't be published, so nothing is accepted and no rival is declined. The raised purchase inherits its shipping address from the purchase the quote already belongs to when there is one; a quote states no destination, so this is the one path that publishes a goods purchase without one, and its order can't be sent until someone sets it on the purchase. Sending the order is a separate step once the purchase is approved; there is no path from a quote to a PO that skips approval.","tags":["Quotes"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Accept a quote","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AcceptQuoteResult"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request body or query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"401":{"description":"Authentication required","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"404":{"description":"Resource not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}},"422":{"description":"A domain rule was violated (e.g. illegal status transition)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"}}}}}}},"/api/quotes/{id}/decline":{"post":{"summary":"Decline a quote","description":"Marks the vendor out of the running. A hand decline survives a competitor's acceptance (it is not overwritten by the soft auto-decline).","tags":["Quotes"],"parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"id","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"required":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Decline a quote","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Quote"},"meta":{"type":"object","propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"additionalProperties":{}}},"required":["data"],"additionalProperties":false}}}},"400":{"description":"Inva