{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"title":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"description":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The buy's human description — durable header truth (the requisition's editable prose), rendered on both the pre- and post-order surfaces."},"vendor_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},{"type":"null"}]},"created_by":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},{"type":"null"}]},"assignee_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},{"type":"null"}]},"lifecycleStatus":{"description":"The pre-order lifecycle: draft → pending_approval → approved (+ terminal rejected, cancelled). Durable header truth; draft/pending_approval/rejected/cancelled are shown directly, while approved hands off to the derived milestones below. A non-request buy (recorded PO, cold bill) is born approved.","$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseLifecycleStatus"},"archived_at":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Set once archived — hidden from the default list, and its open tasks and blocking exceptions out of the inbox. Reversible."},"created_at":{"type":"string"},"updated_at":{"type":"string"},"expected_delivery_date":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The purchase-level estimated delivery date (YYYY-MM-DD) — when the goods are expected to arrive, the same value a PO carries. Human/agent-set; overrides derived estimates."},"need_by_date":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The buyer's need-by date (YYYY-MM-DD) — when the purchase is required. Owned by the purchase outright (the PO carries no copy); editable at any stage."},"poReference":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The order's PO number, or null when the purchase has no order yet (a purchase carries at most one order)."},"awaitingPayment":{"type":"boolean","description":"Invoiced but not yet paid — drives the 'Awaiting payment' status and the assignee's payment task."},"health":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseHealth"},"attentionCount":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"milestones":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseMilestone"}},"matchedLines":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MatchedLine"},"description":"Line items reconciled across the purchase's documents (quote/PO/receipt/bill). Empty on the list surface."},"lines":{"description":"The purchase's own line items — always present on the by-id read, and on the list with `expand=lines`. A line with `po_id` set is on the order.","type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseLine"}},"lineDocKinds":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MatchDocKind"},"description":"Which document kinds exist on the purchase — a line only reads 'missing' a kind once the purchase has one."},"amounts":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CurrencyAmount"},"description":"Best-known purchase value grouped by currency and NEVER summed across currencies: the winning tier's totals (ordered, else invoiced, else requested/quoted) bucketed by their own currency. One entry in the common single-currency case; more than one when that tier's documents disagree."},"amount":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Convenience single value for the single-currency case: the sole `amounts` entry's number, or null when the purchase has no value OR spans multiple currencies (read `amounts` then)."},"currency":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The sole `amounts` entry's currency, or null when the purchase has no value or spans multiple currencies."},"currencyMismatch":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the purchase's money-bearing documents (POs, bills, requests) reference more than one currency — a signal to show per-currency subtotals and flag the divergence; we don't convert."},"lastActivityAt":{"type":"string"},"documents":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseDocRef"}},"team_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The team this purchase belongs to — stamped at creation from the request that raised it (else the creator's primary team), and what visibility scoping filters on."},"team_inherited":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when `team_id` comes from an originating request, which owns it: the purchase's team then follows that request's, and PATCHing team_id here is refused (422 team_inherited)."},"team_ids":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"description":"The purchase's EFFECTIVE team(s), for the list's team filter: `[team_id]` when stamped, else inherited from its request(s) (their stamped team, else the requester's memberships), else the owner's memberships."},"requisition":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseRequisitionDetail"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The purchase's pre-approval requisition surface — the record in request vocabulary plus its lines, approval workflow, vendor-approval + onboarding gate, sourcing, governing contract, PO-document terms, email origin and comments. Present while the purchase is still pre-approval (draft / pending_approval / rejected); null once approved, when the reconciliation fields above (milestones, matched lines, three-way health) carry the surface instead."}},"required":["id","organization_id","title","description","vendor_id","created_by","assignee_id","lifecycleStatus","archived_at","created_at","updated_at","expected_delivery_date","need_by_date","poReference","awaitingPayment","health","attentionCount","milestones","matchedLines","lineDocKinds","amounts","amount","currency","currencyMismatch","lastActivityAt","documents","team_id","team_inherited","team_ids","requisition"],"additionalProperties":false},"PurchaseLifecycleStatus":{"type":"string","enum":["draft","pending_approval","approved","rejected","cancelled"]},"PurchaseHealth":{"type":"string","enum":["attention","on_track"]},"PurchaseMilestone":{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MilestoneKey"},"present":{"type":"boolean"},"at":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"evidence":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseDocRef"}}},"required":["key","present","at","evidence"],"additionalProperties":false},"MilestoneKey":{"type":"string","enum":["quoting","quoted","ordered","invoiced","paid","shipped","received","closed"]},"PurchaseDocRef":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PurchaseDocType"},"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$"},"label":{"type":"string"},"status":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"at":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"n